# The optional front end's toolchain and its build output stay out of the index:
# `node_modules` is installed by npm, and `assets/dist` is what `npm run build`
# produces for `rust-embed` to embed. Neither is source, and the crate's build
# script names the npm command when the bundle is missing — which is only a real
# failure if the bundle is not committed.
/node_modules/
/web/node_modules/
/web/schema/
/web/src/gen/
/target/
/assets/
